OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FGenerally cloudy with spells of
OL,6,Fdrizzly showers, although there may be
OL,7,Fsome brighter spells in the afternoon,
OL,8,Fparticularly in the south. A brisk
OL,9,Fbreeze, particularly on coasts and
OL,10,Fhills, easing through the day. Feeling
OL,11,Fmild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy, with spells of
OL,14,Fdrizzle becoming more persistent
OL,15,Fparticularly over mountains in the
OL,16,Fnorth. Winds easing further to a light
OL,17,Fbreeze by dawn. Feeling chilly in the
OL,18,Fnorth.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
