OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FRain and cloud and a milder
OL,6,Ffeel may linger in the south. Cumbria
OL,7,Fwill gradually become drier and
OL,8,Fbrighter although with a fresher feel
OL,9,Fin a gentle northerly breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FWednesday and Thursday will be bright
OL,13,Fwith sunny spells and a cool, autumnal
OL,14,Fbreeze. Showers most likely over
OL,15,Fmountains on Wednesday. A return to
OL,16,Fmild, unsettled weather on Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
